<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 10.032A Standard Heart Brilliant</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Steele, Norman W; Seattle F Design, Aug 91</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Crown and pavilion extensively modified to approximate</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">diagram given in 10.032 reference.</text>
